This is a modified copy of latex-rust 2.1.1 from crates.io
(https://github.com/jscarr64/LaTeX-Rust), kept in the Kition Note kit.
Changed by the Kition authors: src/color.rs takes the dvips color names
(\color{TealBlue} and the other 67) from a table of their own, with each
name's CMYK definition, in place of upstream's data/dvipsnames.tsv, which
this copy does not contain. Everything else in src/ and data/ is unchanged;
upstream's tests, golds, benches and documents are left out.

